   31-35)4 boys divide among them 100Rs.A and C have same money as B
         and D.D as 1/2 as much as B has. A has 5Rs more than B.

   sol: a+b+c+d = 100
        a+c = b+d
	d=b/2
	a=b+5

	solving these eq's we get c=b/2 - 5
        
	 a = 100/3 + 5 ,  b = 100/3 ,  c= 100/6  - 5 , d = 100/6

